      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "similar problem here in germany, around the time when the index controller update came, which was like what two months ago, it for some reason stopped downloading with the full speed my isp can provide. I'm paying for 250mbit/13mbit, pc is receiving around 180mbit down. speedtest.net, fast.com etc all give consistent results around the 180mbit mark, this however will stick to 40mbit all the time. I asked someone I know that lives around the southern part of germany to do the same test and despite having a different isp with even higher speeds that I do he is getting the same results. So there's that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
